OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey and gloomy start to
OL,6,FNovember with low cloud and drizzly
OL,7,Foutbreaks. This cloud will clear
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards into the afternoon,
OL,9,Fwhen it will turn drier with a few
OL,10,Fsunny spells developing. Temperatures
OL,11,Faround average for the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTonight, it will feel much
OL,14,Fchillier under clear skies with a
OL,15,Ftouch of frost in rural, exposed
OL,16,Fareas. Remaining dry with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
