OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start on Monday,
OL,6,Fremaining dry throughout for many with
OL,7,Fjust the odd light shower further
OL,8,Feast. Feeling fresher in a northerly
OL,9,Fbreeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FRemaining largely dry and fine through
OL,13,Fthe period with high pressure
OL,14,Fdominating. Plenty of sunny spells on
OL,15,Foffer, yet with the risk of the odd
OL,16,Flight shower where cloud thickens.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
